#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/io.rst:4
msgid "Input/output"
msgstr "输入/输出"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/io.rst:7
msgid ""
"LiteFrame IO functions read and write tabular data without index-specific"
" metadata. All read functions use Arrow dtypes "
"(``dtype_backend=\"pyarrow\"``) by default. Write functions have no "
"``index`` or ``index_label`` parameters because LiteFrame has no index "
"semantics."
msgstr ""
"LiteFrame IO 函数读取和写入表格数据，不包含特定于索引的元数据。所有读取"
"函数默认使用 Arrow 数据类型（``dtype_backend=\"pyarrow\"``）。写入函数"
"没有 ``index`` 或 ``index_label`` 参数，因为 LiteFrame 没有索引语义。"

